	(text "Note 1: Transistor Q3 was only\nmarked 8050 on its casing. It was\ninitially assumed to be the\nFairchild SS8050 with pinout EBC.\nHowever, the pin layout was\ndifferent. Research suggests it\nis most likely the Asian clone\nUTC8050S (pinout ECB). This must\nbe taken into account when\ntroubleshooting or replacing\nthe transistor."
